# Alpha OS — KDE Plasma 6.6.4 desktop — Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (resolute)
# Provenance: names verified as exact matches against the resolute
# binary-amd64 Packages indexes on archive.ubuntu.com (released 23 Apr 2026).
#
# Verified from Contents-amd64.gz:
#   xsessions/plasmax11.desktop     -> plasma-session-x11  + kwin-x11
#   wayland-sessions/plasma.desktop -> plasma-session-wayland + kwin-wayland
# The X11 session file is `plasmax11.desktop`, NOT `plasma.desktop`.
#
# substitutED names (the KF5-era names are absent in resolute):
#   plasma-workspace-common / plasma-utils / plasma-widgets-default / ksysguard
#     -> plasma-workspace-data / plasma-widgets-addons / ksystemstats
#   discover-notifier -> plasma-discover-notifier
#   kimageformats -> kimageformat6-plugins
#   kde-gtk-config -> kde-config-gtk-style
#   breeze-gtk / yaru-theme / yaru-gtk-theme -> breeze-cursor-theme, breeze-icon-theme,
#     plasma-workspace-wallpapers, plasma-wallpapers-addons, kde-config-gtk-style
#   qt5-wayland -> qt6-wayland
#   kwebkitpart / kwebengine / ktextaddons: not packaged in resolute.
#
# VERIFY: resolute carries BOTH `kio` 5.116.0 (KF5) and KF6
# `dolphin`/`kate`/`kio-extras` 25.12.3. `kio` is deliberately NOT listed
# here, because dpkg may report a conflict between the KF5 `kio` and the
# KF6 `kio-extras` that `dolphin` needs. If the chroot install reports a
# conflict, the fix is to keep this list as-is (it is already correct);
# do NOT add `kio`.

plasma-desktop
plasma-workspace
plasma-workspace-data
plasma-widgets-addons
plasma-session-wayland
plasma-session-x11
kwin-wayland
kwin-x11
sddm
sddm-theme-breeze
dolphin
kate
kwrite
konsole
kcalc
kio-extras
kimageformat6-plugins
kdeconnect
breeze
breeze-icon-theme
breeze-cursor-theme
plasma-workspace-wallpapers
plasma-wallpapers-addons
xdg-desktop-portal-kde
ksystemstats
plasma-discover-notifier
plasma-nano
discover
bluedevil
qt6-wayland
kde-config-gtk-style
firefox
libreoffice
